#. module: catering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:catering.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"For items like beverages or rented materials that are delivered directly to "
"the event, use a dropship operation. Before you begin, be sure the event "
"location is registered in your contacts."
msgstr ""
"Untuk barang seperti minuman atau perlengkapan rental yang dikirim langsung "
"ke lokasi acara, gunakan layanan dropship. Sebelum memulai, pastikan lokasi "
"acara sudah terdaftar di daftar kontak Anda."

#. module: catering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:catering.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"For large catering events, different types of logistics are required to get "
"all the products and materials where they need to go. By registering these "
"movements in Odoo, you can ensure every item is accounted for. Here's how to "
"manage\n"
"            each type of purchase and delivery."
msgstr ""
"Untuk acara katering berskala besar, diperlukan berbagai jenis logistik "
"untuk mengantarkan semua produk dan bahan ke tempat yang dituju. Dengan "
"mencatat pergerakan ini di Odoo, Anda dapat memastikan setiap item tercatat "
"dengan baik. Berikut cara mengelola\n"
"            setiap jenis pembelian dan pengiriman."

