"within the template."
msgstr ""
"Hal ini memungkinkan Anda untuk menambahkan field kustom—seperti <b>area "
"teks , gambar, atau dokumen</b>—untuk mengumpulkan informasi spesifik tepat "
"di tempat yang dibutuhkan dalam template."

#. module: catering
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:catering.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This module helps you manage every step of the process, from initial "
"customer relationships to event planning and execution. With it, you can "
"effortlessly prepare and validate events, purchase the necessary raw "
"materials, and\n"
"            efficiently track your entire operation."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini membantu Anda mengelola setiap langkah dalam prosesnya , mulai "
"dari hubungan awal dengan pelanggan hingga perencanaan dan pelaksanaan "
"acara. Dengan modul ini, Anda lebih mudah dalam mempersiapkan dan "
"memvalidasi acara, melakukan pembelian bahan baku yang diperlukan, serta\n"
"            melacak seluruh operasional secara efisien."

#. module: catering
#: model:product.template,description_sale:catering.product_product_127_product_template
msgid ""
"This package includes a dedicated wait staff positioned behind the bar for "
"the entire duration of the event. Please note, this service does not cover "
"table service after the dessert course.\n"
"\n"
"The package includes:\n"
"\n"
"- Soft drinks and sodas\n"
"- Still and sparkling water\n"
"- Red and White Wine\n"
"- Beers\n"
"\n"
"The predefined price package is calculated based on an allowance of 5 non-"
"alcoholic and 5 alcoholic drinks per guest. Any drinks consumed above this "
"allowance will be itemized and charged separately after the event."
msgstr ""
"Paket ini termasuk wait staff yang menunggu di belakang bar untuk seluruh "
"durasi acara. Mohon diingat, layanan tidak termasuk table service setelah "
"dessert.\n"
"\n"
"Paket termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- Soft drink dan soda\n"
"- Still and sparkling water\n"
"- Anggur Merah dan Putih\n"
"- Bir\n"
"\n"
"Harga paket yang ditentukan sebelumnya dihitung berdasarkan paket 5 minuman "
"alkoholik dan 5 minuman non-alkoholik per tamu. Minuman apa pun yang "
"dikonsumsi di atas paket tersebut akan dicatat dikenakan biaya terpisah "
"setelah acara."

